# Blood Sun ("All lands lose all abilities except mana abilities", layer 6) with Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth ("Each land is a
# Swamp in addition to its other land types", layer 4) and two Footfall Craters ("Enchanted land has '{T}: Target creature
# gains trample and haste until end of turn.'", layer 6).
# - Urborg's ability applies in layer 4, before Blood Sun's effect takes it in layer 6 (CR 613.1, 613.6; the ruling: "that
#   ability will apply before Blood Sun removes that land's abilities"): every land is still a Swamp, so Bot2's Island taps
#   for {B} on turn 4 and Mutavault, entering after the Sun, is a Swamp too.
# - Each Crater's grant is a layer-6 effect with the Crater's timestamp (CR 613.7). The one on Urborg came before the Sun,
#   so the Sun takes the ability it gave (Urborg used it on turn 2, the positive control, and cannot on turn 5); the one put
#   on Mutavault after the Sun gives an ability the land keeps (the ruling: "If a land gains an ability after Blood Sun has
#   entered the battlefield, it keeps that ability"), and Mutavault gives Ornithopter trample and haste with it.
# - Mutavault keeps "{T}: Add {C}" and its Swamp's "{T}: Add {B}", and has no "{1}: ... becomes a 2/2".

[Bot1 Deck]
Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Footfall Crater
Footfall Crater
Blood Sun
Mutavault
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Footfall Crater.Cast(Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Activate(Ornithopter; Ability: Target creature)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Haste; Trample
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot1.Hand.Blood Sun.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Swamp
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
? Bot2.Mana = {B}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Footfall Crater.Cast(Mutavault)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Activate(Ability: Target creature)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: becomes a 2/2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ornithopter; Ability: Target creature)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Haste; Trample
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
? Bot1.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Subtypes = Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Swamp
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Subtypes = Island; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Footfall Crater#2.AttachedTo = Mutavault
